                                "sense_id": "a96de30b-a3fb-3523-bfe1-f7ae0ea24e4e",
                                "text": "In woede gaf ze hem een oorvijg.",
                                "translation": "In anger, she gave him a cuff on the ear.",
                                "english": "In anger, she gave him a cuff on the ear."
                            },
                            {
